I'll restructure TrueFit AI into a more complete mobile app flow, with the landing page and authentication screens appearing before the main fashion experience.

The new single-file version will include:

- Welcome / landing page with brand introduction and Get Started / Sign In actions.
- Login screen with email, password, password visibility, and validation.
- Sign-up screen for new users.
- Home dashboard with Pinterest-inspired fashion discovery.
- AI Fit Studio with measurement profile controls.
- Tailor discovery with search and sample tailor cards.
- Saved designs and favorites.
- My Orders screen.
- Profile and settings screen.
- Modern mobile bottom navigation, animations, and polished UI.

Authentication and order data will be demo-only for now; no Firebase or other packages are needed for this UI prototype.

